OL,3,GNEWSAPunch in bar felt like a
OL,4,Asledgehammer, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was hurt in an unprovoked
OL,7,Fattack in a bar that left his friend
OL,8,Fwith fatal injuries has described the
OL,9,Fpunch feeling like being "hit with a
OL,10,Fsledgehammer", a murder trial has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FGiving evidence at Stafford Crown Court
OL,14,Fearlier, Adam Cooper, 62, said there
OL,15,Fhad been no warning of the events that
OL,16,Funfolded at the Ricco and Loren bar in
OL,17,FLichfield, Staffordshire, on 24 May.
OL,19,FBilly Allison, 36, denies murdering
OL,20,FMatthew O'Gara, 44, but has pleaded
OL,21,Fguilty to manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
